{"t":"Mystic Flame","s":"mystic-flame-53998","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Mystic_Flame_94d45d.gif","q":8,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Mystic Flame</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Mystic Flame\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mystic_Flame_94d45d.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Navigation<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleporters</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ccccff; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">2 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mapcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Map Color</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.3<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 11, 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150130103822&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mystic_Flame_94d45d.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a mystic flame.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">You feel drawn to the mesmerizing light.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Usually found in Quests.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Mystic Flames have various purposes, most prominently they act as <a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleports</a>, as in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Tombs\">Ankrahmun Tombs</a> which teleport the player deeper if they sacrifice a <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab%20Coin\">Scarab Coin</a> in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Coal%20Basin\">Coal Basin</a>. Other flames, such as the flames inside <a href=\"#/wiki/Morguthis\">Morguthis</a>' Deathslicer Arena, are scripted in other ways that do not act as teleports.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Agostina\">Agostina</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Alberto\">Alberto</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a></li><li>Ankrahmun NPCs</li><li>Assistant NPCs</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/cults-of-tibia-quest\">Cults of Tibia Quest</a></li><li>Dwarf NPCs</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></li><li>Edron NPCs</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Emilio\">Emilio</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fabiana\">Fabiana</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/forgotten-knowledge-quest\">Forgotten Knowledge Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/grimvale-quest\">Grimvale Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a></li><li>Kazordoon NPCs</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/lions-rock-quest\">Lion's Rock Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lorenzo\">Lorenzo</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Forcefield\">Magic Forcefield</a></li><li>Magic Shopkeeper NPCs</li><li>Navigation</li><li>Open-Air Theatre</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab%20Coin\">Scarab Coin</a></li><li>Secret Hideouts</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleporters</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></li><li>Thais NPCs</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-ancient-tombs-quest\">The Ancient Tombs Quest</a></li>